        Root cause:
        The bug was likely caused by the absence of a version check in the application ID handling, which could lead to compatibility issues if different versions of the interface were used. This oversight could result in the driver accepting an incompatible application version, potentially causing unexpected behavior or crashes. The patch introduces a version field and checks to ensure that the application version matches the expected version, thereby preventing such issues.

